sonic-trace
Test fixtures in fixtures/community/ are copied unmodified from
sonic-net/sonic-utilities (tests/dump_input/), which is licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. Copyright 2016-2020 Microsoft, Inc.
They are hand-made unit-test data, not captures from a running switch.

fixtures/logs/ and fixtures/multi-asic/: the log files are hand-written to match the
line formats in sonic-swss and sonic-sairedis; their message text is synthetic, not
real orchagent output. multi-asic/asic0 and asic1 are copies of the community
vlan and route data above.

fixtures/bundle/: synthetic, generated by tools/gen-bundle-fixture.py in the layout of a
generate_dump support bundle. Its VLAN data and the dump/*.json.1 files are copies of the
community data above; the routes, VRF objects and logs are hand-made from the formats in
the SONiC source.
